{1}{The smell of orc blood brings joy to my heart.}{The smell of orc blood brings joy to my heart.}{}{1}{}{}
{2}{It is quite invigorating to rid the world of these foul creatures, isn't it?}{It is quite invigorating to rid the world of these foul creatures, isn't it?}{}{2}{}{}
{3}{There are never enough dead orcs, as my father used to say.}{There are never enough dead orcs, as my father used to say.}{}{3}{}{}
{4}{You must stop this wanton destruction of life or I will be forced to stop you myself.}{You must stop this wanton destruction of life or I will be forced to stop you myself.}{}{4}{}{}